  "claim": "Lance King has spent time in the heavy metal music industry. The lead singer of the album QR III has spent less time than Lance King.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Kevin DuBrow. Sentence: Kevin Mark DuBrow (October 29, 1955 November 19, 2007) was an American heavy metal singer, best known as the lead vocalist of the heavy metal band Quiet Riot from 1975 until 1987, and again from 1990 until his death in 2007.\nPage: Lance King. Sentence: Lance King (born November 23, 1962) is an American heavy metal vocalist specializing in melodic rock progressive and power metal.\nPage: Lance King. Sentence: Lance has sung with many groups over the last 35 years and started the record label Nightmare in 1990 to release his own music and is presently still at the helm of the label.\nPage: QR III. Sentence: It is the last album to feature lead singer Kevin DuBrow until the 1993 album \"Terrified\".",
